[ar:ANDREWBATES]
[ti:Emotion.]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : Andrew Bates/Eilidh Cowan
[00:01.00]作曲 : Andrew Bates/Eilidh Cowan
[00:14.84]You've been out late, no phone
[00:14.84]你在深夜外出 一无音讯
[00:17.81]Say nobody's there but I know you
[00:17.81]说那里没有其他人 而我怎会不懂
[00:21.34]I can feel the rain when you go
[00:21.34]我能清晰感受到你离开时的雨
[00:24.36]Ain't nothing but a cloud hanging over our love
[00:24.36]我们的关系正处于阴云之下 不似别物
[00:29.71]Why do I feel like you don't even try
[00:29.71]为什么我觉得你连试都不肯一试
[00:32.41]And everyone changes
[00:32.41]人心易变
[00:36.00]But I don't feel like you want me there
[00:36.00]你可能不太希望我待在你身边
[00:39.03]I feel your energy like an ocean
[00:39.03]你就像那不息的海洋
[00:42.02]You only come in waves of emotion
[00:42.02]情绪永远如海浪般起落
[00:45.15]And everybody knows it
[00:45.15]无人不知无人不晓
[00:58.10]Nothin' but love for you
[00:58.10]我孤注一掷地爱着你
[01:01.53]I could go wild for you
[01:01.53]甚至愿意为你疯狂
[01:05.29]I don't answer your calls on a daily basis
[01:05.29]我也不是每日都准时接起你的电话
[01:10.89]I could O.D on you
[01:10.89]却仍对你欲罢不能
[01:14.11]Maybe I don't need you
[01:14.11]也许我并不需要你
[01:17.52]We are both the same
[01:17.52]我们生来相同
[01:20.54]Playing all these games
[01:20.54]玩着人生游戏
[01:23.71]But I'll take the blame for you and I, that's all I'm good for
[01:23.71]不过我会替你承担责任 我只擅长这些了
[01:30.01]I feel your energy like an ocean
[01:30.01]你就像那不息的海洋
[01:33.14]You only come waves of emotion
[01:33.14]情绪永远如海浪般起落
[01:36.43]And everybody knows it
[01:36.43]无人不知无人不晓
[01:49.50]Nothin' but love for you
[01:49.50]我孤注一掷地爱着你
[01:52.61]I could go wild for you
[01:52.61]甚至愿意为你疯狂
[02:02.25]Nothing but love
[02:02.25]唯有爱
[02:05.14]Oh I could go wild
[02:05.14]我将为爱疯狂
[02:10.21]I think I need you
[02:10.21]我想我需要你
[02:14.03]But never mind leave me lonely
[02:14.03]但不要紧 留我独自一人
[02:22.07]And I'm thinking of you
[02:22.07]任你在脑海中盘桓
[02:26.67]When everyone leaves I will be
[02:26.67]在所有人都离去 茕茕孑立之时
